    "simplifiedExplanation": "<div class=\"lesson-content\"><section class=\"step-card\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"lesson-icon target\"></span><h3>Step-by-step method</h3></div><ul><li>If two groups are joined, the total stays the same.</li><li>Start with the bigger number if it makes counting easier.</li></ul></section></div>",
