    "simplifiedExplanation": "<div class=\"lesson-content\"><section class=\"step-card\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"lesson-icon target\"></span><h3>Step-by-step method</h3></div><ul><li>Roman numerals to 100 is like organizing values so each digit or part has a clear job.</li><li>Use a number line, blocks, or money to see the idea before calculating.</li></ul></section></div>",
