    "simplifiedExplanation": "<div class=\"lesson-content\"><section class=\"step-card\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"lesson-icon target\"></span><h3>Step-by-step method</h3></div><ul><li>Moments studies change, closeness, or accumulated value.</li><li>A graph helps you see the meaning before using symbols.</li></ul></section></div>",
    "advancedExplanation": "<div class=\"lesson-content\"><section class=\"concept-card\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"lesson-icon sparkles\"></span><h3>Next mathematical idea</h3></div><p>Moments connects local change, limiting behavior, approximation, or accumulation.</p>\n<p>Advanced analysis makes this precise using functions, convergence, continuity, differentiability, or integration conditions.</p></section></div>",
