    "introduction": "<div class=\"lesson-content\"><section class=\"lesson-introduction\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"lesson-icon book-open\"></span><h3>Lesson focus</h3></div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PG / MSc Core / Complex Analysis / Advanced Complex Analysis</p><h2>Meromorphic functions</h2><p>Meromorphic functions is a specific idea in Advanced Complex Analysis.</p>\n<p>Meromorphic functions studies functions, limits, operators, or integrals using precise analytic conditions.</p>\n<p>The hypothesis controls convergence, boundedness, or equality.</p>\n<p>It matters because students must know exactly when the method or theorem is valid.</p></section></div>",
