    "advancedExplanation": "<div class=\"lesson-content\"><section class=\"concept-card\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"lesson-icon sparkles\"></span><h3>Next mathematical idea</h3></div><p>Meromorphic functions depends on function space, topology, and convergence.</p>\n<p>The advanced question is often which norm or weak notion preserves the result.</p></section></div>",
